<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have spread from the Northwest and Southwest to Yaounde, Douala and Maroua as security forces confront Ambazonian separatists, while separatist attacks persist in the Anglophone regions ten years after the crisis began. UNESCO has joined national efforts to prevent femicide in Cameroon. Metal Shark is constructing patrol boats for Cameroon, indicating a focus on maritime security. The Cameroon Senate President publicly denied social media rumours of an assassination attempt against him. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;StopBlaBlaCam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQa25iTnJIcXVwQzVaMk1nRW9wZGRvdWlqTkpZOERVWDgyVWMxbHBqUm1uSGJ0QUxvZlJ4b1VNZlh4SjJpWUFSYS1HQ1pSMFVPdFpwWnFkZmN6OXk4dHhkZnVDbEs2Q2ZLMkxtaDVoX3dycHJrTnVGNDNoWlFTdHRBSmhKUTZRRi1MeEoxVnhSTFcyWGV5aVU5RkxUR181SHZoZ2RwMFdmZ2hMc3hESzEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPY05sclMxdE9BWGtjcGJzRHZWRHRWZUpBOWhmRkxlUDhBbWsyT2tPcndzZTUtVGVZdDQwT082Ui1tXzRkTjRhT3FiVjUyelVNVFM4N0hsSGlpUmJRbGlEUUQydG5sQkloY09ZV3N1cTBOTnhEaVBqYk9lQVRudUFCZElXUTRZLTZOcUw0WHE5ODE5b1RENVlRaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NavalToday&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOejktTkYySERMLXo2SFhJSU5mcmNyLTkyUnhqR3o5VkJmbklJY3ZTZFU0YkVtam00V0JIcDBmalJtYkZ0R1MxWUV